        "Content": "Mitchell Douglas Lettings/Management & Sales -\r\npresent this stunning an immaculate, turn-key 3 bedroomed\r\nsemi-detached available for its first letting.\r\nMaintained to the highest standards, this exceptional home\r\noffers modern finishes, natural light and space in a prime,\r\nhighly convenient setting.\r\nInside, the home boasts bright and airy living space designed\r\nfor modern living.\r\nThe Ground floor features a welcoming hallway leading to\r\na comfortable living area with feature fireplace, doubled doors\r\nleading to a contemporary fully fitted kitchen/dining areas\r\nand versatile extension space. Office with bathroom off\r\nand utilityroom.\r\nUpstairs offers three well appointed bedrooms and a stylish fully\r\ntiled bathroom.\r\nTo the rear, the property features a private garden, perfect for\r\nrelaxing or outdoor entertaining.\r\nSituated just a short stroll from frequent local bus services for\r\nan easy commute. Close to local schools, shops and essential amenities."
